# Licensing map

Copyright (c) 2026 Dehao Lin, for owner-authored material.

| Material | License |
|---|---|
| Owner-authored code, scripts and tooling | MIT License, in LICENSES/MIT.txt |
| Owner-authored manuscript, prose, README files and documentation | Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), in LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt |

Third-party material and pre-existing sealed/frozen artifacts are excluded from these blanket grants. They retain their existing notices, rights and licenses. No statement in this repository license changes the byte-preserved sealed artifacts' existing legal status or grants rights the owner does not hold. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

The newly authored public manuscript v0.1.2 and its metadata/declarations are covered as owner-authored prose. Sealing a new distribution does not extend this grant to its embedded pre-existing proof, audit, source or reproducibility artifacts. Code and prose remain subject to the distinct licenses above.

The CC BY 4.0 legal text is included locally in full. Its canonical identifier is https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode .
